# Research Integrity

Classify evidence as:

OBSERVED
MEASURED
DOCUMENTED
INFERRED
SIMULATED
REPLAYED

Never represent simulated or replayed evidence as a newly measured live experiment.

Never fabricate:

- attack results
- telemetry
- scanner findings
- Splunk results
- control effectiveness
- model performance
- framework mappings

Every experiment should capture:

run.id
lab.id
AgentSec version
model
security profile
attack
expected behavior
actual behavior
telemetry
control result
detection result
limitations

Store reproducible experiment evidence under:

artifacts/<run-id>/
